ser, this has actually been one of the most innovative decades that cinema has ever seen. Whether down to technology or desperation, the film industry has spent these last few years figuring out new ways to make films that simply could not have existed even at the turn of the decade.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/23/how-2020s-decade-revolutionised-cinema">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ckS_Hn0uKA9xcTTD31ImAt-qi8Hz9ZNZCwn8F13BvpQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;-XDbrFvDiHMmVTqyPRUqPcA_ckeK_VMP5cORs5ZHL0sƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8bJUBPzpA44vKWmotZPIl89SGco0k2v8tE9eKy1Btycƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eKdptxsneXtE6m2zuyVqHBA1fecyzarbOfrggXbxQToƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VR76pVHKOIWBgQUMRqTNTk8cv83l4qvt-VC7t9jQH9Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cXIaIVU4OQU7V5quspKfCQK2XZ8MbRIgeoQdOGNh8XQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fZqkvDNGIM6RIH2NLy89rtEU3jobrtEPMmqeVUItphMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;b9SNTWhGHk8JoWCbPsT7hd26ZMq3888zfyHRz1gDKzgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;aZNmFYhhLszcYkIX_YBgxfyTmfhUY5GAbqOtq1DhtDgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒeri